    "paste_text": "Porygon2 @ Eviolite  \r\nAbility: Download  \r\nLevel: 50  \r\nTera Type: Fighting  \r\nEVs: 252 HP / 76 Def / 172 SpA / 4 SpD / 4 Spe  \r\nModest Nature  \r\n- Tera Blast  \r\n- Ice Beam  \r\n- Trick Room  \r\n- Recover  \r\n\r\nIncineroar @ Sitrus Berry  \r\nAbility: Intimidate  \r\nLevel: 50  \r\nTera Type: Ghost  \r\nEVs: 252 HP / 196 Atk / 28 Def / 4 SpD / 28 Spe  \r\nAdamant Nature  \r\n- Fake Out  \r\n- Knock Off  \r\n- Flare Blitz  \r\n- Parting Shot  \r\n\r\nUrsaluna @ Flame Orb  \r\nAbility: Guts  \r\nLevel: 50  \r\nTera Type: Ghost  \r\nEVs: 140 HP / 252 Atk / 116 Spe  \r\nAdamant Nature  \r\n- Headlong Rush  \r\n- Facade  \r\n- Earthquake  \r\n- Protect  \r\n\r\nJumpluff @ Covert Cloak  \r\nAbility: Chlorophyll  \r\nLevel: 50  \r\nTera Type: Fire  \r\nEVs: 252 HP / 60 Def / 196 Spe  \r\nTimid Nature  \r\nIVs: 0 Atk  \r\n- Rage Powder  \r\n- Sunny Day  \r\n- Tailwind  \r\n- Sleep Powder  \r\n\r\nCharizard @ Choice Specs  \r\nAbility: Solar Power  \r\nLevel: 50  \r\nTera Type: Ghost  \r\nEVs: 4 HP / 252 SpA / 252 Spe  \r\nTimid Nature  \r\nIVs: 0 Atk  \r\n- Heat Wave  \r\n- Overheat  \r\n- Weather Ball  \r\n- Dragon Pulse  \r\n\r\nTorkoal @ Eject Pack  \r\nAbility: Drought  \r\nLevel: 50  \r\nTera Type: Fire  \r\nEVs: 252 HP / 252 SpA / 4 SpD  \r\nQuiet Nature  \r\nIVs: 0 Atk / 0 Spe  \r\n- Overheat  \r\n- Eruption  \r\n- Helping Hand  \r\n- Protect  \r\n\r\n",
